" Sourced automatically from ~/.tridactylrc on startup (needs :nativeinstall).
" Symlink it: ln -s ~/proj/dotfiles/tridactyl/.tridactylrc ~/.tridactylrc
" Dump live config anytime with :mkt! and merge the output back here.

" --- appearance ---
set modeindicator false

" --- hints ---
set hintchars hjklasdfgyuiopqwertnmzxcvb
set hintfiltermode vimperator-reflow

" --- behaviour ---
set searchengine duckduckgo
set yankto both
set viewsource vsplit
set followpagepatterns.next next|more|>>|→
set followpagepatterns.prev prev|previous|<<|←

" --- updates ---
set update.nag false

" --- examples (uncomment to use) ---
" External editor (Ctrl-i) via the native messenger:
" set editorcmd nvim
" Faster tab switching:
" bind J tabprev
" bind K tabnext
" Ignore keys on an app-like site, except for your pass-through key:
" autocmd DocStart mail.google.com mode ignore
" Site-specific bind:
" bindurl ^https://github.com f hint -Jc [title]
" Custom ex command:
" command h tabopen {args}

:composite js tri.styling.THEMES | fillcmdline
